{
  "about": "veffrrrr: a multi-stage distortion after Ableton Roar's serial routing (drive and tilt, two shaper+filter stages, a gated feedback delay, output, mix), in the unit's own lists of effects (sounds and master) and on fx train's wagons. Knobs: drive, s1, s2, mix; with shift held four sub-pages (s1, s2, fb, out; shift and a press of the 1st knob steps them). Text page. Stands on nitro; changes no place of the firmware; needs the base.",
